				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="ewa-rteLine">The KBD Plus joystick is purpose-built for professional PTZ operation, delivering smooth response, precise positioning, and long-term reliability. Unlike generic joystick modules, it is engineered specifically for professional camera operation.</div><div class="ewa-rteLine">&nbsp;</div><div class="ewa-rteLine">– Tested to over 1 million motion cycles to ensure long-term durability</div><div class="ewa-rteLine">– Maintains precise control accuracy, with only 0.7% deviation after 500,000 rotations</div><div class="ewa-rteLine">– Designed for long operational life, supporting 700,000+ real-world control actions</div>								</div>
				</div>
